1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,250
Yeh push nahi bachega.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:08,700
The team bol rahi hai wait, lekin
yeh banda still takes the door.

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:14,500
Loot girta hai aur the call
is simple: airdrop, ya zone?

4
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:20,962
A third party walks in from behind.

5
00:00:20,962 --> 00:00:25,550
Jo abhi hero ban raha
tha, ab sirf bachna hai.

6
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:28,850
Akela mat push karna.
